.TH NCGET 1 "November 2026" "litenc 1.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ncget \- read operational data from a NETCONF device
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ncget
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Establish an SSH NETCONF session, exchange capabilities, send a get request,
and print the reply to standard output. Session status is written to standard
error.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-server " address"
Server address. The default is localhost.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " port"
Server port. The default is 830.
.TP
.BI \-\-user " username"
Login user. The default is the USER environment variable.
.TP
.BI \-\-password " password"
Use password authentication. When omitted, use an SSH private key.
.TP
.BI \-\-private\-key " file"
Private key file. The default is $HOME/.ssh/id_rsa.
.TP
.BI \-\-public\-key " file"
Public key file. The default is $HOME/.ssh/id_rsa.pub.
.TP
.BI \-\-xpath " expression"
Select operational data with an XPath filter.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose\-session
Print all sent and received NETCONF messages to standard error.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show available options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR get-net (1)
